WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Lie on your left side with knees soft.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Place a pillow between the knees and under the belly.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Rest the head on a pillow.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Breathe slowly.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Switch sides if needed.
